# Raw evidence under docs/internal (logs, archives, results data) stays out of the tree;
# written reports (*.md) stay. Evidence removed on 2026-11-05 is in history:
# git show 8b8afec97:<path>
docs/internal/**/*.log
docs/internal/**/*.gz
docs/internal/**/results/**
!docs/internal/**/results/**/
!docs/internal/**/results/**/*.md

